{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7980","id":5219428219,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABNxonew","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7980","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7980.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7980.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7980","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7980/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7980/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7980/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/statuses/0d8fdd73370200989bc9a47c174ddf2e410b5f50","number":7980,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"docs(id): framing & fragmentation decision across carrier classes (#5810)","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nDecision record for #5810: framing and fragmentation across the three carrier classes (stream, datagram, store-and-forward).\n\n- `doc/2026-11-09_decision_id5810_carrier_framing.md` — the decision, rejected alternatives, normative invariants (general + per-carrier), required conformance coverage, and scope/follow-ons.\n- `planning/architecture/README.md` — index entry.\n\n## Decision in one line\n\nThe adapter boundary carries **one canonical serialized postcard frame**; an adapter adds only the framing its carrier needs and removes it before handing the frame to ID. Stream = length-prefixed frames; datagram = whole frame or the existing checked-chunk representation (never IP fragmentation); store-and-forward = opaque object or checked chunks, assembled before decode.\n\n## Acceptance mapping\n\n- Decision record posted and linked from #5810 (done)\n- Chosen shape + rejected alternatives + invariants (done)\n- Parent #5674 cross-reference; explicitly \"frozen parent decisions changed: none\" (done)\n- Does not split further; sibling ownership (#5808, #5809, #5813, #5814, #5815) named (done)\n\nNo code changes; design only. Verification is documentation checks: record present, invariants for all three carriers, parent cross-reference.\n\nCloses #5810\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796795673&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7980&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7980&signature=f8196a36f3c9ac892bd819959a1c1059041350d37a16b45cd824febfb86c7cb9\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/